  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "name": "NanoPi R6S / RK3588S NPU driver port for OpenWrt",
  "alternateName": "openwrt-r6s-rknpu",
  "description": "Experimental Rockchip RKNPU 0.9.8 R10 driver port to Linux 6.12.112 on the FriendlyElec NanoPi R6S, with three-core device-tree and IOMMU integration, OpenWrt packaging and optional private GNU runtime recipes. Motivated by exploring Kitsune-inspired network anomaly detection; the application implementation and models are excluded. Build and synthetic verification does not establish detection accuracy, NPU speedup or reproduction of the paper's results.",
